{"data2":{"type":"k","award":{},"naics":[{"code":["541511"],"type":"primary"}],"title":"Cultural Property Prototype","archive":{"date":"2026-10-06","type":"auto15"},"version":"2","permissions":{"IVL":{"read":false,"create":true,"delete":true,"update":true}},"solicitation":{"setAside":"SBA","deadlines":{"response":"2026-09-21T17:00:00-04:00","responseTz":"America/New_York"}},"organizationId":"500026360","pointOfContact":[{"fax":"","type":"primary","email":"diangelome@state.gov","phone":"","title":null,"fullName":"Mary DiAngelo"}],"classificationCode":"DA01","placeOfPerformance":{"country":{"code":"USA","name":"UNITED STATES"}},"solicitationNumber":"19AQMM26Q0468","additionalReporting":["none"]},"additionalInfo":{"sections":[{"id":"header","status":"updated"},{"id":"general","status":"updated"},{"id":"classification","status":"updated"},{"id":"description","status":"updated"},{"id":"attachments-links","status":"updated"},{"id":"contact","status":"updated"}]},"parent":{},"related":{},"status":{"code":"published","value":"Published"},"archived":false,"cancelled":false,"latest":true,"deleted":false,"postedDate":"2026-09-14T15:15:01.662+00:00","modifiedDate":"2026-09-14T15:15:01.669+00:00","createdDate":"2026-09-14T15:02:37.249+00:00","modifiedBy":"diangelome@state.gov","createdBy":"diangelome@state.gov","description":[{"opportunityId":"bde8de729e4647a9ae1815fa06236e1f","descriptionId":"cf7ff7eedf504cd1a80c1e8e421ab466","modifiedOn":"2026-09-14T15:15:01.671+00:00","body":"<p>The purpose of this requirement is to procure a prototype for a cultural property identification tool powered by artificial intelligence (AI) that can serve as a proof-of-concept for testing by U.S. law enforcement and assessment for the feasibility and desirability of further development and potential future acquisition.</p>\n\n<p>The RFQ document is attached to this announcement, as well as the Statement of Work and mandatory Cybersecurity questionnaires.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Questions in response to thi